test(gemini): production-grade generateContent cassette suite (#2004)

Adds 11 live-recorded cassette regression tests locking down long,
multi-turn, multi-tool Gemini sessions:

- sequential tool calls across turns with strict caller-history
  ordering (streaming + non-streaming parity);
- long client-owned history replay with model text before the
  functionCall part and after the functionResponse, verified against
  the wire format (user/model roles, functionResponse in user role,
  systemInstruction top-level), plus model-version and usage checks;
- thinking-enabled session surfacing thoughtsTokenCount as reasoning
  tokens in usage;
- function-call argument shapes: deeply nested objects with arrays,
  unicode/escaped strings, and an optional nullable field correctly
  omitted when not requested;
- ToolChoice::Required mapping to bare {"mode":"ANY"} forcing a call
  (completes the existing Specific/None tool_choice coverage);
- MAX_TOKENS truncation preserving the finish reason, partial text,
  and model version (thinking disabled so text survives the cap);
- structured output with nested objects, arrays, and optional fields.
